    `Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component of a product` `the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control` `the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety`
    WHERE
