      `the party is a product manufacturer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a product manufacturer?
      `it places an AI system on the market or puts it into service together with its product` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you place an AI system on the market or put it into service together with your product?
      `it does so under its own name or trademark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you do so under your own name or trademark?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
