-- seat questions of seat manufacturer from part P3 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P3-seat-manufacturer: the questions of Articles 16 to 27 of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744), asked as a product manufacturer
-- A thin layer: every question calls one decision function of the layer-1 modules and restates no rule. The inputs that all questions of this part share carry the same name and the same description in every question.
-- Reading a result: JUST TRUE yes; JUST FALSE the text says no in its own words; NOTHING the text does not answer (the provision does not yet apply, the list is not closed, the provision limits itself, or the text points outside the sources).
-- The role questions and the applicability question come first; a caller that is not sure of the role asks the role question before the duty questions.

